{"cwd": "/home/user/rainbow-", "entrypoint": "remote_mobile", "gitBranch": "ccr-8b6fc834-7kd55l", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"content": "autosave-cron.sh\nautosave-daemon.sh\nautosave-hook.sh\ncapture.mjs\ncinematic-test.mjs\ncloud-env-setup.sh\ncompare.py\ncontinuity-test.ts\nexport-models.mjs\nexport_claude_sessions.py\ngameplay-test.mjs\ninstall-autosave-scheduler.sh\nlib\nrainbow-autosave.py\nreference.sha256\nsetup-android-sdk.sh\nsetup-blender.sh\nwater-lab.mjs\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# Claude Code hook entry point:  autosave-hook.sh <SessionStart|PreCompact|Stop|SessionEnd>\n# SessionStart re-arms the 5-minute scheduler (a fresh cloud container has no crontab yet).\n# Stop runs in the background so it never delays a turn; PreCompact/SessionEnd run inline (bounded).\nEVENT=\"${1:-hook}\"\nREPO=\"$(cd \"$(dirname \"${BASH_SOURCE[0]}\")/..\" && pwd)\"\ncat > /dev/null 2>&1   # drain hook JSON from stdin\ncase \"$EVENT\" in\n  SessionStart)\n    bash \"$REPO/scripts/install-autosave-scheduler.sh\" > \"$HOME/.rainbow-autosave-install.log\" 2>&1\n    setsid nohup \"$REPO/scripts/autosave-cron.sh\" \"hook:SessionStart\" >/dev/null 2>&1 < /dev/null &\n    ;;\n  Stop)\n    setsid nohup \"$REPO/scripts/autosave-cron.sh\" \"hook:Stop\" >/dev/null 2>&1 < /dev/null &\n    ;;\n  PreCompact|SessionEnd)\n    timeout 110 \"$REPO/scripts/autosave-cron.sh\" \"hook:$EVENT\" >/dev/null 2>&1\n    ;;\nesac\nexit 0\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# Fallback scheduler used only when cron is unavailable: one autosave every 300 s.\nREPO=\"$(cd \"$(dirname \"${BASH_SOURCE[0]}\")/..\" && pwd)\"\nwhile true; do\n  \"$REPO/scripts/autosave-cron.sh\" daemon\n  sleep 300\ndone\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# Installs (idempotently) the Rainbow five-minute autosave scheduler on this machine.\n#   * Linux with cron  -> crontab entry  */5 * * * *  + starts the cron daemon if it is not running\n#   * no cron available -> falls back to a detached loop daemon (scripts/autosave-daemon.sh)\n# Sessio